"specialty"><td><div class="nutrient-name">Ammonium Lignosulphonate</div><div class="chemical-formula">Chelating Agent</div></td><td class="percentage">2.50%</td><td class="description">Aids in binding and delivering micronutrients like iron and zinc, improving root uptake efficiency.</td></tr><tr class="micronutrient"><td><div class="nutrient-name">Zinc</div><div class="chemical-formula">(Zn)</div></td><td class="percentage">0.10%</td><td class="description">Stimulates hormone production (auxins) and enzyme activity; supports shoot elongation and leaf growth.</td></tr><tr class="micronutrient"><td><div class="nutrient-name">Iron</div><div class="chemical-formula">(Fe)</div></td><td class="percentage">0.10%</td><td class="description">Essential for chlorophyll production; prevents interveinal yellowing in young leaves (iron chlorosis).</td></tr><tr class="micronutrient"><td><div class="nutrient-name">Manganese</div><div class="chemical-formula">(Mn)</div></td><td class="percentage">0.08%</td><td class="description">Vital for photosynthesis, nitrogen metabolism, and defence against oxidative stress.</td></tr><tr class="micronutrient"><td><div class="nutrient-name">Boron</div><div class="chemical-formula">(B)</div></td><td class="percentage">0.04%</td><td class="description">Regulates cell wall formation and pollen viability, both of which are crucial for reproductive success and root elongation.</td></tr><tr class="specialty"><td><div class="nutrient-name">Kelp Extract</div><div class="chemical-formula">(Ascophyllum Nodosum)</div></td><td class="percentage">0.25%</td><td class="description">Natural source of growth hormones (cytokinins, auxins), trace minerals, and stress protectants.</td></tr></tbody></table>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"-24","left":"0","isLinked":false},"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text":"This is Tooltip","element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration":"300","element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing":"ease-out"},"el