                    <span class="card-value">Optional foliar mist for vigor.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-row">
                    <span class="card-label">Soil Vitality Max:</span>
                    <span class="card-value">Broadcast to the planting area to boost microbial life.</span>
                </div>
